    { q:"What message did the angel give the women at the tomb?", choices:["The body was moved by the gardener","The disciples must come and pay the watch","He is not here: for he is risen, as he said","They must wait until the passover ends"], a:2, why:"The angel said, Fear not: he is not here, for he is risen, as he said; come, see the place where the Lord lay." },
    { q:"What commission did the risen Christ give the eleven on the mountain in Galilee?", choices:["Remain in Jerusalem and pray","Rebuild the temple's veil","Go teach all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father, Son, and Holy Ghost","Write the book of remembrance"], a:2, why:"Jesus sent them to teach all nations, baptizing in the name of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Ghost, promising to be with them alway." }
